{
  "sequence_id": "seq_dcebdbbf614a9b4d",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Their days-long slather movie marathon began!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "- [Sugquotyl]>"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And at last, the day before the cooking practice arrived!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Blood ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "So much blood..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "So beautiful- full..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "OKAY..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You look like you can tolerate blood now."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yes,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Life... is so fleeting... so beautiful..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Then it's time for the real thing! I"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "filler the fish!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I will... cut you to pieces..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "TH..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "That's the spirit..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Little fish..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I will bring you... to a new plane of exis- fence..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "........."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'll call you Philly!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Food time!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "NOO!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "YOU CAN'T!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "He's my little baby!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "YOU CAN'T EAT HIM!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "HULL- UHHHH!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If you have to eat someone, eat me!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "How would I even do that!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If we're not going to fillet it, then what are you going to do with it!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm taking him home with me!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Can you even take care of a fish on your own!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yes, I can!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "THE DAY FINALLY ARRIVED..."
    }
  ],
